#!/usr/bin/env python3
# Managed by thin-client-setup
"""Explicit, non-destructive native Brave/VS Code setup for this thin client.

Commands: install (download/update), migrate (copy once), integrate (launchers),
prepare (all three), status, open brave|code [arguments]. Launchers NEVER download.
No sudo, process killing, old-profile removal, SSH edits or home fallback.
Optional graphical login setup uses XDG Autostart; shell startup is untouched.
See README.md for storage details and LICENSE for licensing terms.
"""
